# tests/ — the recipients tests

Run: `luajit src/recipients/tests/050-run-tests.lua [project folder] [stand-in | real]`
(project folder defaults to `/home/ritz/programs/rao-chat`, neighbours to
`stand-in`).  Prints one `pass`/`FAIL` line per test and a final tally;
exits 1 on any failure.  Scratch homes go under
`tmp/shared-memory/recipients/run-<time>-<random>/` (RAM).

| file | what it is | outward shape |
|---|---|---|
| `042-stand-in-room-folders.lua` | a small copy of issue 101's module, to the contract | returns the same table of functions as `002-room-folders` |
| `043-stand-in-message-log.lua` | a small copy of issue 105's module (tab-separated log) | returns `new_message_id`, `append`, `has_message`, `read`, `read_ordered`, `copy_log` |
| `045-test-harness.lua` | wiring and helpers | returns `function(dir, neighbours) -> h`; `h.check(name, fn)`, `h.expect_error(fragment, fn)`, `h.equal(got, want, what)`, `h.same_set(list, list, what)`, `h.file_exists(path) -> bool`, `h.new_home(label, contacts list, own-device list, config table) -> home`, `h.message(author, text) -> message`; `h.rooms`, `h.log`, `h.recipients` are the loaded modules |
| `046-test-add-remove.lua` | adding and removing rules | returns `function(h)` |
| `047-test-split.lua` | both split shapes, both parent settings, room of two | returns `function(h)` |
| `048-test-arrival.lua` | the three arrival modes | returns `function(h)` |
| `049-test-six-become-two-fives.lua` | the owner's six-person example on six homes, every shape × mode | returns `function(h)` |
| `051-test-options.lua` | the options file's shape | returns `function(h)` |
| `050-run-tests.lua` | the runner | a script |
